  "mic": "XMEX",
  "name": "Mexican Stock Exchange",
  "note": "2010-2024 sourced from exchange_calendars only (backfill; not independently verified). 2025-2029: exchange_calendars + exchange_publications. Regular hours (4b4, ADR 0013/0014): 08:30-15:00 per BMV's Manual Operativo (continuous trading; no closing auction, close = 15:00). BMV runs 07:30-14:00 while the US is on daylight saving time (Manual 1.1.3); regular_hours cannot express that, so the evidence is schema_limited (4f backlog: sessions that follow another market's daylight saving time).",
  "regular_hours": {
    "close": "15:00",
    "open": "08:30"
  },
  "sessions": [
    {
      "close": "08:30",
      "open": "07:30",
      "type": "pre_market"
    },
    {
      "close": "15:00",
      "open": "08:30",
      "type": "regular"
    },
    {
      "close": "15:30",
      "open": "15:00",
      "type": "post_market"
    }
  ],
  "timezone": "America/Mexico_City",
  "verification": {
    "basis": "divergence_report",
    "class": "reference_compared",
    "coverage": {
      "from": "2010-01-01",
      "ranges": [
        "trading_days"
      ],
      "sources": [
        {
          "from": "2010-01-01",
          "sampled": null,
          "source": "exchange_calendars",
          "to": "2024-12-31"
        },
        {
          "from": "2025-01-01",
          "source": "exchange_calendars + exchange_publications",
          "to": "2029-12-31"
        }
      ],
      "to": "2029-12-31"
    },
    "hours": [
      {
        "backlog_item": "Sessions that follow another market's daylight saving time",
        "checked_on": "2026-11-23",
        "close": "15:00",
        "close_rule": "continuous_end",
        "effective_from": "2010-01-01",
        "limitation": "BMV moves the whole session one hour earlier while the United States is on daylight saving time, to stay aligned with New York: 7:30-14:00 Mexico City then, 8:30-15:00 otherwise (Mexico abolished its own daylight saving time in 2022). regular_hours has no season, so the entry holds the 8:30-15:00 schedule and is_open and in_session are an hour wrong from the second Sunday of March to the first Sunday of November.",
        "note": "Manual Operativo, 'Versión 1.97/2026', 'Vigencia a partir del 23 de julio de 2026' (the maintainer's PDF, 107 pages, read directly in 4b6), 1.1.2 'Horario de la Sesión de Remate': 'c) Mercado contínuo para títulos de renta variable, de renta fija y warrants de 8:30 a 15:00 horas.'; 'b) Subastas de Apertura ... de 8:00 a 8:29:59 horas.'; then 'El horario de la Sesión de Remate durante el horario de verano (estacional) en Estados Unidos, para fines de mantener homologado el horario de la sesión de remate de la BMV con el horario del mercado de Nueva York, será el siguiente:' with 'c) Mercado continuo para títulos de renta variable, de renta fija y warrants de 7:30 a 14:00 horas.'; 'Los horarios de inicio de cada etapa ... se aplicarán de manera aleatoria entre la hora señalada y el segundo inmediato siguiente' (seconds of jitter: the stated times). 1.1.3: 'durante el horario de 8:30 a 15:00 horas (7:30 a 14:00 horas durante el horario de verano EUA) de la Sesión de Remate'. Close (ADR 0013): the manual has no closing auction; 1.3.6.6.2 sets the closing price as the 'PPP' of 'los precios de los últimos 20 minutos de la Sesión de Remate', closing-price orders (HC) execute 'a las 15:00 horas', and orders after the close (HD) run 15:01:00-15:19:59 (not regular hours). So close 15:00, the end of continuous trading; open 08:30. 4b4 read the same manual through WebFetch; this replaces that reading. The maintainer's saved 'Horarios de Negociación' tab gives the US-summer table 'Mercado Continuo 7:30 a 14:00' under a heading 'Anterior' (the English tab labels 8:30-15:00 'Previous', so the heading dates nothing). BMV's avisos page (15 October 2025, 'Homologación de los horarios de operación del Mercado de Capitales con los de EUA'): from Monday 3 November the session 'iniciará a las 8:30 horas para concluir a las 15:00 horas'. Close (ADR 0013): BMV has no closing auction; the closing price is calculated from 'los precios de los últimos 20 minutos de la Sesión d